---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import Heading from '../components/Heading.astro';import Metrics from '../components/Metrics.astro';import {path} from '../lib/site';
const groups=[['Educational access & youth development','Free STEM experiences through Uplift Academy Ohio, including NextGen Coders, NextGen Mentors, and Innovation Camp. The work brings younger students, volunteers, and families together around learning.','uplift-academy-ohio','Read the Uplift story'],['Entrepreneurship & student opportunity','Mason Venture Studio connects student founders with practical startup experience and mentorship. The initial cohort included 12 teams; their ideas and effort are central to the program’s story.','mason-venture-studio','Meet Venture Studio'],['Financial literacy & mentorship','ATMIYA uses instruction and simulated portfolios to help students explore financial concepts. ME Experiential Learning connects elementary learners with high-school mentors and Junior Achievement curriculum.','atmiya','Explore financial education']];
---
<Base title="Impact"><Heading label="Community comes first" title="What becomes possible for someone else?" description="That question connects my work in education, entrepreneurship, and service. These are accounts of the opportunities we created together—and the evidence available so far."/><section class="section"><Metrics/></section>{groups.map(([title,text,slug,label])=><section class="list-row"><h2>{title}</h2><div><p>{text}</p><a href={path(`projects/${slug}/`)}>{label} →</a></div></section>)}<section class="list-row"><h2>International service & connection</h2><div><p>From September 2023 to June 2024, I volunteered with Aprendiendo Juntos in Guadalajara, teaching English to Spanish-speaking community workers. Sessions ran for approximately two hours on Fridays.</p><p>I adapted instruction for adult learners with different educational backgrounds. The experience helped me practice listening, cross-cultural communication, and teaching with the learner in mind.</p><p class="source">Brag sheet, p. 10. No verified learner total is supplied.</p><a href={path('journal/teaching-in-guadalajara/')}>Read the service account →</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="two-col"><h2>A careful record<br/>of progress.</h2><div><p>Participation tells us who took part. It does not, on its own, show lasting changes in skills, confidence, or access. This site keeps those distinctions visible.</p><p>Annual impact reports will be added when reporting periods and supporting records are confirmed. There is no completed annual report claimed here.</p><a href={path('evidence/')}>How the figures are documented →</a></div></div></section></Base>
